== AP-13: escalonamento de privilegio (2a iteracao da skill) ==

$ curl -X POST http://localhost:5000/users  -d '{"name": "Atacante", "email": "atk1785003556@x.com", "password": "1234", "role": "admin"}'   # auto-cadastro pedindo role=admin -> role IGNORADO, grava 'user'
  -> HTTP 201  {"active":true,"created_at":"2026-07-25 18:19:16.323760","email":"atk1785003556@x.com","id":4,"name":"Atacante","role":"user"}

$ curl -X DELETE  -H 'Authorization: Bearer <token>' http://localhost:5000/users/2   # token do atacante NAO abre rota de admin -> 403
  -> HTTP 403  {"error":"Requer privil\u00e9gio de admin"}

$ curl -X PUT http://localhost:5000/users/5  -d '{"name": "X"}'   # PUT SEM token -> 401 (antes era 200 publico)
  -> HTTP 401  {"error":"N\u00e3o autorizado"}

$ curl -X PUT  -H 'Authorization: Bearer <token>' http://localhost:5000/users/5  -d '{"password": "invadida"}'   # takeover de senha de OUTRO usuario -> 403
  -> HTTP 403  {"error":"N\u00e3o autorizado a alterar este usu\u00e1rio"}

$ curl -X PUT  -H 'Authorization: Bearer <token>' http://localhost:5000/users/5  -d '{"role": "manager"}'   # admin legitimo ainda promove -> 200 com role aceito
  -> HTTP 200  {"active":true,"created_at":"2026-07-25 18:19:16.612792","email":"alvo1785003556@x.com","id":5,"name":"Alvo","role":"manager"}

$ curl -X DELETE  -H 'Authorization: Bearer <token>' http://localhost:5000/users/5   # delete COM token admin -> 200 (transacional)
  -> HTTP 200  {"message":"Usu\u00e1rio deletado com sucesso"}
